{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "station-auth-test-collection",
		"name": "FoodTech Kitchen - Station Authorization Tests",
		"description": "Collection to test station-based authorization for kitchen staff.\n\n**Business Rules:**\n- Bar staff can ONLY update BAR station tasks\n- Hot kitchen staff can ONLY update HOT_KITCHEN station tasks\n- Cold kitchen staff can ONLY update COLD_KITCHEN station tasks\n- Admin can update ANY station tasks\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n1. Auth0 tenant configured\n2. Test users created with appropriate roles\n3. Application running on localhost:8080\n\n**Variables to Set:**\n- `auth0_domain`: Your Auth0 domain (e.g., dev-xyz.us.auth0.com)\n- `auth0_client_id`: Your Auth0 application client ID\n- `auth0_client_secret`: Your Auth0 application client secret\n- `auth0_audience`: Your API audience (e.g., https://kitchen-service-api)\n- `api_base_url`: Your API base URL (default: http://localhost:8080)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Setup - Get Tokens",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get Token - Admin User",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"admin_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
									"    console.log(\"Admin token saved:\", jsonData.access_token.substring(0, 20) + \"...\");",
									"} else {",
									"    console.error(\"Failed to get admin token:\", pm.response.text());",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"password\",\n  \"username\": \"admin@foodtech.com\",\n  \"password\": \"YOUR_ADMIN_PASSWORD\",\n  \"client_id\": \"{{auth0_client_id}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{auth0_client_secret}}\",\n  \"audience\": \"{{auth0_audience}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "https://{{auth0_domain}}/oauth/token",
							"protocol": "https",
							"host": [
								"{{auth0_domain}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"oauth",
								"token"
							]
						},
						"description": "Get Auth0 token for admin user (has admin:all permission)"
					},
					"response": []
				},
